{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1307635-status-and-storylines","id":1307635,"title":"Status and storylines","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-24T17:43:54-07:00","id":1307635,"title":"Status and storylines","content":"Question: If a player uses manages to put themselves in a position where they could gain a title in a Consilium but don\u2019t have the experience to buy the level of status necessary, how would you treat it? Particularly if it\u2019s a Silver Laddr character who could potentially use that status in their Lex Magica merit. Curious how it\u2019s been addressed in others games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T18:14:36-07:00","id":1307641,"title":"","content":"Story earned Merits are a thing, if they want it to be important to their character and give them narrative control for having that status they buy the Merits when they can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T19:08:20-07:00","id":1307652,"title":"","content":"The most important aspect of buying them is the sanctity of merits. And I guess mechanical use? But mostly sanctity of merits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T19:40:43-07:00","id":1307660,"title":"","content":"I let the players go in debt. A single merit dot is only 1xp, so they're only in the negative for one or two sessions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T19:58:59-07:00","id":1307662,"title":"","content":"If you want to be mean about it you can give them the position but have their lack of status represent how little authority they actually hold, or that the posting is dependent upon the support of another, sometimes demanding member of the Consillium. Rather like the Nemean's herald in Boston.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Ma